Build 052 (diagnostic only): the depth probe logs every texture element (not only depth-compare ones) of programs
that use depth compare, with the guest TIC (raw, format, type, address, size), to depth-samplers.txt and the log.
For the screen shadow mask, whose static sun shadows are gated by linear depth from texture c2[0x20] (< 25 m).

